WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am here with the NASCAR
championship four --

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
Joey Logano, Kyle Busch,
Martin Truex Jr.,

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.577 line:92%
and Kevin Harvick right there!

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:13.146 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys are
the best of the best

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.615 line:92%
when it comes to auto racing,

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:19.019
but I want to see how impressive
you are on a smaller scale.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm talking about
remote-control cars.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.357
And we've -- we've designed
a pretty crazy obstacle course.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
We want to see
how well you can handle it.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's time for the
"Tonight Show" RC Pro-Am.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:35.235 line:92%
-♪♪ Tonight Show RC Pro-Am ♪♪

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.037 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
Here's what's gonna happen.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:40.106
First, we're gonna head down
this ramp right here, okay?

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.041 line:92%
We're gonna complete three laps,

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
around the mini
Rockefeller Center ice rink.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
Be careful --
it's very slippery.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.047 size:78% position:39%
And then we're gonna
have to weave through

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.715 line:92%
three orange traffic cones,

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
pass by a beautiful
New York Cityscape,

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:55.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
over a rocky road,
through #SwingingLegs,

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
under the tunnel,
and then the first person

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:01.795
to launch themselves over
the final ramp is the champion.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.696 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.165 line:92%
All right, get your remotes.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get ready.
-Oh, boy.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.201
-Are you good at this?
-Have you ever done this before?

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am not -- No.
I played the game "RC Pro-Am."

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you remember that?
-I loved that thing, man.

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:13.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was awesome.
-Awesome game.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.574 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Joey doesn't.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've never even heard of it.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.111 line:92%
You're such a baby, yeah.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.814
-Have you heard of Nintendo?
-I've heard of that, yeah.

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Perfect.
I got to catch you up.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're gonna love it.
All right, wait.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.452
Let me see if I can do this.
Are you guys good at this?

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, he's cheating already.
-Making sure it works.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
Joey, oh, my gosh.
Here we go.

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, Higgins?
-Everybody ready?

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-On your mark, get set, go!

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.230 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.165 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:42.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh!
Come on, help me!

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.838 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's it.
Two laps is enough.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:52.045 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-That one's in third.

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:53.980 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.849 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Stop! What are doing?!

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:57.283 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, my gosh!

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Bell dinging ]

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
For the win!

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
For the win!
-Bring it back.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:05.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh.
-You're off-roading.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're off-roading!

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How did you get
out of the circle, man?

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.195 line:92%
-I don't know, I don't know.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
Put it back in!
Let's go!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.665 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Go!

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:13.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.069 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:17.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How did it go in
and come back out?

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just throw it.
Higgins, just throw it over!

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, ready?
-Let's do it!

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oohh!
[ Laughing ]

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:30.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh,
just took it out right there.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:30.683 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That was major.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:34.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
My thanks to Joey Logano,
Kyle Busch, Martin Truex Jr.,

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
the champion!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.559 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Congratulations, Martin.

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:41.027 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And Kevin Harvick!

